              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2023-01-23"^^xsd:date ;
              rdfs:comment "Indicates if a certain property is TSI compliant.The reason for deprecation is that it is used in SKOS \"OtherPantographHeads\" and \"TsiPantographHeads\" to indicate in the first case if a SKOS concept is not tsiCompliant (false) and in the second case that the concept is tsiCompliant (true). These two SKOS were originally one SKOS, \"PantographHeads\". Currently with the two SKOS the property is redundant."@en ;
              rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/949/> ;
              rdfs:label "Tsi compliant"@en ;
              owl:deprecated "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
              <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" .


